WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.659 --> 00:00:06.029
So yesterday there were some really interesting
moments during Donald Trump's corona virus

00:00:06.029 --> 00:00:07.170
press briefing.

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:11.259
One of them was when within minutes Donald
Trump went from saying, I'm withholding money

00:00:11.259 --> 00:00:14.610
from the W.H.O. to denying that he ever said
that.

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:15.980
We already looked at that.

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.189
I mostly have not been playing clips from
these press briefings each day, because if

00:00:21.189 --> 00:00:26.130
I did, the entire show would be clips from
the press briefings which have essentially

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:31.410
replaced Donald Trump's political rallies
in the era of Corona virus as a way for him

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:32.960
to get out his propaganda.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:38.350
And he probably to some degree kind of like
gets off from doing these press briefings

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:39.640
would be my guess.

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:43.280
But yesterday, there were a couple of things
that I really want to highlight, because they

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:49.629
go beyond the Corona virus story alone and
they bleed over into some other important

00:00:49.629 --> 00:00:54.670
issues, one being the November of 2020 election
and how to do it safely.

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:57.220
And the idea of voting by mail.

00:00:57.220 --> 00:01:01.770
Now, Nancy Pelosi has already said we should
vote by mail in 2020.

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:04.190
I played that clip for you last week.

00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:08.620
Coronavirus makes it dangerous for people
to mass gather at polling places.

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:14.940
Although we are expecting a decline starting
very soon, that will go through July August.

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:21.290
We're not exactly sure until when in November
we will likely be in the second wave of Corona

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:23.030
virus cases.

00:01:23.030 --> 00:01:25.350
But Donald Trump has been very critical of
voting by mail.

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:26.350
Why?

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:29.410
Well, we know why he admitted it, because
it would help Democrats win.

00:01:29.410 --> 00:01:31.320
And you don't have to take my word for it.

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:34.710
Here is Trump himself saying that exact thing.

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:36.420
Just last week, I will tell you this.

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:41.350
If you look at before and after the things
they had in there were crazy.

00:01:41.350 --> 00:01:45.310
They had things, levels of voting that if
you ever agreed to it, you'd never have a

00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:47.570
Republican elected in this country again.

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:53.740
They had things in there about, you know,
election days and what do you do and all sorts

00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:55.070
of clawbacks.

00:01:55.070 --> 00:01:59.890
And they had things that were just totally
crazy and had nothing to do with the workers

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:01.100
that lost their jobs.

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:02.100
All right.

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:06.320
So we know Trump knows voting by mail would
be bad for Republicans.

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:07.950
It would be bad for him.

00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:11.860
So yesterday during the coronavirus press
briefing, he again went on about how vote

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:12.910
by mail is bad.

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:14.830
Vote by mail is corrupt.

00:02:14.830 --> 00:02:16.500
Vote by mail is fraudulent.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:22.040
But a reporter accurately pointed out that
and this was being carried live on Fox News

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:23.100
and on other networks.

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:25.680
Mind you, a reporter points out, wait a second.

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:30.060
Mr. President, you voted by mail in Florida
just a few days ago.

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:34.270
If it's so bad and corrupt, why is it that
you're doing it?

00:02:34.270 --> 00:02:36.910
And Trump says the quiet part out loud, admitting.

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:39.070
Well, it's OK for me to do it.

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:41.100
It's just not OK for other people to do it.

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:42.410
Take a look at this video.

00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:47.990
You were highly critical mail in voting, failing
your mail in ballots for mail and anything

00:02:47.990 --> 00:02:52.430
as voting rights erupt in Florida's election
and last month.

00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:56.340
Sure, I could vote by mail first because I'd
love to.

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:58.920
Well, that's called out of state.

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:00.130
You know why I voted?

00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:01.410
Because I happen to be in the White House.

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:03.270
So they will be able to go to Florida to look
at me.

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:04.460
Just a mailing.

00:03:04.460 --> 00:03:09.930
Well, there's a big difference between somebody
that's out of state and does a ballot and

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:12.230
everything sealed, certified and everything
else.

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:17.730
You see what you have to do with the certifications
and you get thousands and thousands of people

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:23.811
sitting in somebodys living room signing bell
mail in voting is horrible and corrupt, but

00:03:23.811 --> 00:03:25.440
I'm allowed to do it.

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:29.870
Trump clearly imploding here and tries to
wildly suggest, well, you know, I'm doing

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:35.020
it from out of state and all of these other
people are talking about doing it in-state.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:36.459
All else being equal, though.

00:03:36.459 --> 00:03:41.220
Isn't it safer to do in-state man vote by
mail because the ballots have to travel ashore?

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:43.580
A smaller distance, a shorter distance.

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:47.470
Doesn't that I mean, it's like it's not really
a big difference, but it seems that if anything,

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:52.350
vote by mail within the state is less risky
than what Donald Trump is doing.

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:55.000
It's absolutely and completely incoherent.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:58.790
And I'm actually surprised Fox News didn't
cut away from this altogether.

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:04.670
Mail in ballots are good and convenient for
Trump, but they're bad for everybody else.

00:04:04.670 --> 00:04:08.940
Now, if we had a reasonable president, if
we had a real president at all, I think maybe

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:10.020
it's more accurate.

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:15.810
The president would realize we have a pandemic
and a top priority is we need a safe option

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:16.810
for voting.

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:17.980
It should be transparent.

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:19.570
Vote by mail is not corrupt.

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:26.590
Let's start now or really weeks ago setting
up a vote by mail in every state for everybody

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:27.630
for November.

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:31.000
But Donald Trump has already admitted vote
by mail would be bad for him.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.450
It would be bad for Republicans.

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:33.630
And he's right about that.

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:38.060
Why Democrats are more likely to believe the
science on Corona virus.

00:04:38.060 --> 00:04:41.370
Republicans are more likely to repeat to believe
Donald Trump's propaganda.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:44.770
Democrats are more likely to heed warnings
about social distancing.

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:50.071
So if November comes around and we're in wave
two of the virus and things are dicey, there

00:04:50.071 --> 00:04:55.180
is no doubt that Democrats are more likely
to stay home than Republicans.

00:04:55.180 --> 00:05:02.840
If everyone has a safe, convenient, secure
way to vote from home, Trump realizes accurately

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:04.360
it's not good for him.

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:08.490
That's why we have what we have today, which
is Trump calling vote by mail, dangerous and

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:09.490
corrupt.

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:11.160
But of course, he's doing it.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:16.150
And the only way in which voting by mail is
dangerous is that it makes it more likely

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:20.240
Trump is removed in the fall, which we desperately
need.

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:25.370
And Trump is increasingly desperate to prevent
very, very difficult stuff that we are dealing

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:26.370
with.

